<title>USA: Atlantic Tele-Network Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>Atlantic Tele-Network Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three Months Ended March 31, 1996 and 1997</p>
<p>						   Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							 March 31,</p>
<p>						     1996	   1997</p>
<p> Total revenues				 49,396	47,945</p>
<p> Litigation expenses			 (2,800)	     0</p>
<p> Net Income					3,186	 4,882</p>
<p> Net Income per share			   0.26	  0.40</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>  number of shares			    12,273	12,273</p>
<p>	     (In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Atlantic Tele-Network Inc said net income for the first quarter of 1996 included a one-time, pre-tax charge of $2.8 million, or $0.15 per share after taxes.</p>
